param([ValidateSet('Status','EnablePages','Dispatch','Runs','Run','Pages','Logs','EnableMonitor','MonitorStatus','PushStatus','DispatchPushTest','EnablePush','DisablePush')][string]$Action='Status',[string]$RunId,[ValidateSet('full','focus')][string]$Mode='full')
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop'
$env:GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT='0'
$env:GCM_INTERACTIVE='never'
$credentialLines = "protocol=https`nhost=github.com`n`n" | git credential fill 2>$null
if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw 'No usable local GitHub credential. No token was printed.'}
$credentialMap=@{}
foreach($line in $credentialLines){$pair=$line -split '=',2;if($pair.Length -eq 2){$credentialMap[$pair[0]]=$pair[1]}}
if(-not $credentialMap.password){throw 'No usable GitHub credential.'}
$headers=@{Authorization="Bearer $($credentialMap.password)";Accept='application/vnd.github+json';'X-GitHub-Api-Version'='2022-11-28';'User-Agent'='mf8455-monitor'}
$baseUri='https://api.github.com/repos/Flora614/fly'
switch($Action){
 'PushStatus'{try{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/actions/secrets/PUSHPLUS_TOKEN" -Headers $headers;[pscustomobject]@{secret=$r.name;updated_at=$r.updated_at}|ConvertTo-Json}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){'PUSHPLUS_TOKEN secret is missing'}else{throw}};foreach($name in @('PUSHPLUS_ENABLED','PUSHPLUS_TEST_CONFIRMED')){try{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables/$name" -Headers $headers;$r|Select-Object name,value,updated_at|ConvertTo-Json}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){"$name is not set (disabled)"}else{throw}}}}
 'DispatchPushTest'{$body=@{ref='main';inputs=@{authorize_send='true'}}|ConvertTo-Json -Compress;Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/actions/workflows/pushplus-test.yml/dispatches" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null;'One authorized WeChat test dispatched'}
 'EnablePush'{foreach($name in @('PUSHPLUS_TEST_CONFIRMED','PUSHPLUS_ENABLED')){$body=@{name=$name;value='true'}|ConvertTo-Json -Compress;try{Invoke-RestMethod -Method Patch -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables/$name" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}else{throw}}};'Automatic push enabled after confirmed test'}
 'DisablePush'{$body='{"name":"PUSHPLUS_ENABLED","value":"false"}';try{Invoke-RestMethod -Method Patch -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables/PUSHPLUS_ENABLED" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}else{throw}};'Automatic push disabled'}
 'EnableMonitor'{$body='{"name":"MONITOR_ENABLED","value":"true"}';try{Invoke-RestMethod -Method Patch -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables/MONITOR_ENABLED" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null}else{throw}};'Scheduled monitoring enabled'}
 'MonitorStatus'{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/actions/variables/MONITOR_ENABLED" -Headers $headers;$r|Select-Object name,value,updated_at|ConvertTo-Json}
 'Status'{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $baseUri -Headers $headers; [pscustomobject]@{name=$r.full_name;private=$r.private;defaultBranch=$r.default_branch;permissions=$r.permissions}|ConvertTo-Json}
 'EnablePages'{try{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/pages" -Headers $headers; if($r.build_type -ne 'workflow'){Invoke-RestMethod -Method Put -Uri "$baseUri/pages" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body '{"build_type":"workflow"}'|Out-Null}}catch{if([int]$_.Exception.Response.StatusCode -eq 404){Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/pages" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body '{"build_type":"workflow"}'|Out-Null}else{throw}}; 'GitHub Pages enabled for Actions'}
 'Dispatch'{$body=@{ref='main';inputs=@{mode=$Mode}}|ConvertTo-Json -Compress;Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri "$baseUri/actions/workflows/monitor.yml/dispatches" -Headers $headers -ContentType 'application/json' -Body $body|Out-Null; "$Mode live collection dispatched"}
 'Runs'{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/actions/runs?per_page=5" -Headers $headers;$r.workflow_runs|Select-Object id,event,status,conclusion,html_url,created_at|ConvertTo-Json}
 'Run'{if($RunId -notmatch '^\d+$'){throw 'Numeric run id required'};$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/actions/runs/$RunId/jobs" -Headers $headers;$r.jobs|Select-Object name,status,conclusion,steps|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 7}
 'Pages'{$r=Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "$baseUri/pages" -Headers $headers;$r|Select-Object html_url,status,build_type|ConvertTo-Json}
 'Logs'{if($RunId -notmatch '^\d+$'){throw 'Numeric run id required'};[IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory((Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '../private'))|Out-Null;Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "$baseUri/actions/runs/$RunId/logs" -Headers $headers -OutFile (Join-Path $PSScriptRoot "../private/run-$RunId.zip");'Saved private workflow log archive'}
}
